  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity is helping to&#xa0;meet&#xa0;the critical need in Timor-Leste for quality, relevant learning materials through the regular delivery of three magazine publications per year&#xa0;targeted at young children,&#xa0;primary school teachers, and low-literate adults.</narrative>
